Package: libhdb++2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: HDB++ archiving library for Tango Controls
 libhdb++ is the interface between the HDB++ EventSubscriber and an
 archive database: it loads a database backend at run time (dlopen)
 and passes archive events to it through the AbstractDB interface.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libhdb++-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libhdb++2 (= ${binary:Version}), libtango-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: HDB++ archiving library for Tango Controls (development files)
 libhdb++ is the interface between the HDB++ EventSubscriber and an
 archive database: it loads a database backend at run time (dlopen)
 and passes archive events to it through the AbstractDB interface.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the CMake package configuration
 needed to build HDB++ backends and servers.
